Package: cDiffusion
Type: Package
Title: Non-Linear Dimensionality Reduction via Diffusion Maps
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-06-05
Authors@R: c(person("Hubert", "Zalewski", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                    email = "Hubert.Zalewski2.stud@pw.edu.pl"))
Description: Implements memory-efficient, non-linear dimensionality reduction 
    using Diffusion Maps. Features an automated engine dispatch that dynamically 
    switches between dense exact evaluations for small datasets and a highly 
    optimized, multi-threaded C-engine using Max-Heaps and randomized Singular 
    Value Decomposition (rSVD) for large-scale data.
